# Show recent commits touching a path
Output "04-git-log.gif"
Set Width 800
Set Height 400
Set FontSize 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "yaak show commits from the last 2 days. show a brief summary"
Enter
Sleep 5s

# Confirm execution
Type "y"
Enter
Sleep 3s
